:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Animal Watch []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You descend a little and watch the <<beasttype>> from the air for a while.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们下降了一些高度，在空中观察了一会儿<<beasttype>>。
<</language>>
<<if $NPCList[0].type.includes("fox")>>
  <<if $phase is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> starts digging in front of a small patch of earth, drops the object in, buries it, and runs off.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>在一小块土面前开始挖掘，将那个物件扔进去，埋好，然后跑走了。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> curls up on a small patch of ground, dozing.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>蜷缩在一小块土地上，打着盹。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<if $phase is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> drops the thing on the ground and bats at it. After a while, <<bhe>> picks it back up and runs off.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>将那东西扔在地上，对着它拍来拍去。过了一会儿，<<bhe>>又把它捡回来，然后跑走了。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> curls up on a small patch of ground, dozing.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>蜷缩在一小块土地上，打着盹。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch the <<beasttype>> intently the whole time, seeming quite curious about <<bhim>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>全程专注地盯着<<beasttype>>，似乎对<<bhim>>相当好奇。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever") and $phase is 1 and $NPCList[0].type.includes("fox")>>
  <<set _ID to _tempIDs[0]>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname _ID>> seems curious about that object. <<childhe _ID>> chirps at you and flies down to the ground.
      <br><br>
      You land after <<childhe _ID>>, confirm the <<beasttype>> is no longer nearby, then help your child dig up the ground.
      <br>
      You soon dig up the small object <<bhe>> was
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname _ID>>似乎对那个物件很好奇。<<childhe _ID>>冲你叽喳叫，向地面飞去。
      <br><br>
      你跟着<<childhe _ID>>落地，确认<<beasttype>>已经不在附近，随后帮助你的孩子刨开地面。
      <br>
      你们很快挖出了<<bhe>>之前
  <</language>>
  <<if $monster isnot 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        carrying in their beak
      <<option 'CN'>>
        叼
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        carrying
      <<option 'CN'>>
        拿
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      before.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      着的那个小物件。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname _ID>> looks satisfied. You take the thing and leave.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname _ID>>看起来很满意。你们拿着东西离开了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Animal Land []
<<effects>>
<<if $NPCList[0].type.includes("fox")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You land in front of the <<beasttype>> with your wings spread wide.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你降落在<<beasttype>>面前，大张着翅膀。
  <</language>>
  <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("cowardly")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> immediately shrieks at you and runs off. <<bHe>> dropped something.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>立刻对着你们尖叫起来，然后跑走了。<<bHe>>落下了什么东西。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> seems pleased and struts over with their chest out to pick up the object.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>似乎很愉快，挺胸昂首地走过去捡起了那个物件。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("clever")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> stops and tilts its head at you.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>停下来，冲你歪着脑袋。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "I—I didn't steal anything, and I didn't steal any eggs! I swear!"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "我、我什么都没偷，也没有偷蛋！我发誓！"
      <</language>>
      <<if $phase is 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> moves the thing behind itself, as if trying to hide it from you.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>将那个东西移动到身后，仿佛想要藏起来不被你看到。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHis>> tail puffs up; it is clearly terrified of you, but cannot move under your gaze.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHis>>的尾巴炸毛了，很明显非常害怕你，却因为你的目光而无法移动。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname _tempIDs[0]>> watches <<bhis>> puffed-up tail with great interest. The <<beasttype>> soon tucks its tail between its legs.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname _tempIDs[0]>>饶有兴趣地观察着<<bhis>>蓬起的尾巴。<<beasttype>>很快把尾巴团进了两腿之间。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever") and $phase is 1>>
      <<set _ID to _tempIDs[0]>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname _ID>> sneaks around behind the <<beasttype>> while you face off, and takes the object <<bHe>> was hiding.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname _ID>>在你们对峙的时候偷偷溜到了<<beasttype>>的身后，拿走了<<bHe>>藏着的物件。
      <</language>>
      <br>
      <<if $rng gte 50>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The <<beasttype>> shrieks,
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<beasttype>>尖叫一声，
        <</language>>
        <<if $monster is 1>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              "Damn it! When?!"
            <<option 'CN'>>
              "见鬼！什么时候？！"
          <</language>>
        <</if>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> bares its teeth at you in anger and turns to run away.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>恼怒地冲你们呲牙，转身跑开了。
        <</language>>
        <br><br>
        <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch regretfully as <<bHe>> runs off.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>遗憾地看着<<bHe>>跑远。
          <</language>>
        <</if>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname _ID>> proudly shows off <<childhis _ID>> new prize.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname _ID>>自豪地展示<<childhis _ID>>的新收获。
        <</language>>
        <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
        <br><br>
        <<lanLink ["Leave", "离开"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Leave">><</lanLink>>
        <br>
        <<exitAll>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> doesn't seem to notice.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>看起来没有注意到。
        <</language>>
        <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
        <br><br>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      <<lanLink ["Take the object", "拿走那个物件"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Take">><</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanLink ["Pet", "抚摸"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Pet">>
      <<stress -3>>
    <</lanLink>>
    <<lstress>>
    <br>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("clumsy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> stops and tilts its head at you.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>停下来，冲你歪着脑袋。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Oh, wow, your wings are so big and pretty! You won't eat me, right?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "哦，哇哦，你的翅膀好大好漂亮！你们不会吃我的，对吧？"
      <</language>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHis>> tail puffs up; it is clearly terrified of you, but cannot move under your gaze.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHis>>的尾巴炸毛了，很明显非常害怕你，却因为你的目光而无法移动。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname _tempIDs[0]>> watches <<bhis>> puffed-up tail with great interest. This makes <<bHis>> tail puff up even more.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname _tempIDs[0]>>饶有兴趣地观察着<<bhis>>蓬起的尾巴。这让<<bHis>>的尾巴炸毛得更厉害了。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever") and $phase is 1>>
      <<set _ID to _tempIDs[0]>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname _ID>> sneaks around behind the <<beasttype>> while you face off and takes the object.
          <br>
          <<bHe>> doesn't seem to notice.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname _ID>>在你们对峙的时候偷偷溜到了<<beasttype>>的身后，拿走了那个物件。
          <br>
          <<bHe>>看起来没有注意到。
      <</language>>
      <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
      <br><br>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      <<lanLink ["Take the object", "拿走那个物件"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Take">><</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanLink ["Pet", "抚摸"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Pet">>
      <<stress -3>>
    <</lanLink>>
    <<lstress>>
    <br>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("friendly")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> stops and tilts its head at you.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>停下来，冲你歪着脑袋。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Oh, wow, your wings are so big and pretty! You won't eat me, right?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "哦，哇哦，你的翅膀好大好漂亮！你不会吃我的，对吧？"
      <</language>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHis>> tail puffs up; it is clearly terrified of you, but cannot move under your gaze.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHis>>的尾巴炸毛了，很明显非常害怕你，却因为你的目光而无法移动。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
      <<childSelect _tempIDs[0]>>
      <<set _they to (_length gt 1 ? lanSwitch("They","他们") : "<<childhe>>")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch <<bhis>> puffed-up tail with great interest.
          The <<beasttype>> notices
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>饶有兴趣地观察着<<bhis>>蓬起的尾巴。
          <<beasttype>>发现了
      <</language>>
      <<print _they>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          their gaze and wags its tail a few times.
          <<childname>> bobs their head along with the tail's motion.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          的目光，摇晃了几下尾巴。
          <<childname>>跟着尾巴的轨迹晃动脑袋。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
      <<if $monster is 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> giggles, "How cute.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>咯咯笑，"真可爱。
        <</language>>
        <<print _they>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Are they your children?"
            <<bHe>> lowers its upper body to the ground and, at the
          <<option 'CN'>>
            是你的孩子吗？"
            <<bHe>>上半身趴在地上，冲着
        <</language>>
        <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpy chick","小哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            wags its tail, "Want to play with me?"
          <<option 'CN'>>
            摇尾巴，"想和我一起玩吗？"
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> whines deep in its throat, wagging its tail even harder.
            <<bHe>> lies down on the ground, making an inviting pose to play together.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>从喉咙里发出呜呜声，尾巴摇得更欢了。
            <<bHe>>趴在地上，做出邀请一起玩耍的姿势。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Your children
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你的孩子
      <</language>>
      <<if _length gt 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            s
          <<option 'CN'>>
            们
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          circle the <<beasttype>> hesitantly.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          犹豫地绕着<<beasttype>>转圈。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
      <<lanLink ["Watch", "旁观"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Play Yes">><</lanLink>>
      <br>
      <<lanLink ["Take your children and leave", "带着你的孩子离开"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Play No">><</lanLink>>
      <br>
      <<exitAll>>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever") and $phase is 1>>
      <<set _ID to _tempIDs[0]>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname _ID>> sneaks around behind the <<beasttype>> while you face off and takes the object.
          <br>
          <<bHe>> doesn't seem to notice.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname _ID>>在你们对峙的时候偷偷溜到了<<beasttype>>的身后，拿走了那个物件。
          <br>
          <<bHe>>看起来没有注意到。
      <</language>>
      <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
      <br><br>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      <<lanLink ["Take the object", "拿走那个物件"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Take">><</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanLink ["Pet", "抚摸"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Pet">>
      <<stress -3>>
    <</lanLink>>
    <<lstress>>
    <br>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("territorial")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> immediately takes a defensive stance and growls at you.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>立刻采取了防御的姿势，对你低吼着。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "I'm not afraid of you, you wretched harpy! Go screech at someone else!"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "我不怕你，可恶的哈比！去对着其他家伙尖叫吧！"
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> steps forward, ready to attack.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>向前迈近一步，准备好突袭。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
      <<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Suddenly, <<bhe>> is pinned to the ground by something from above. Your <<childname>> lets out a threatening cry from atop the <<beasttypes>> back.
          <br><br>
          <<bHe>> struggles, trying to shake the
        <<option 'CN'>>
          突然，<<bhe>>被上方某个东西按在了地上。你的<<childname>>在<<beasttypes>>背上发出威吓的叫声。
          <br><br>
          <<bHe>>挣扎着，试图把
      <</language>>
      <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpy chick","小哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          off its body.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          从身上抖下去。
      <</language>>
      <<if $monster is 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "You think one little bird can challenge me? Dream on!"
          <<option 'CN'>>
            "就凭你一只小鸟也想挑战我？想得美！"
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <br>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname>> is forced to loosen their grip on the <<beasttype>> a little in the struggle,
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname>>在挣扎下稍微松开了<<beasttype>>一点，
      <</language>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gte 3>>
        <<run _tempIDs = $BirdTower.hunt.ids.filter(item => item !== $BirdTower.hunt.leader)>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            and <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> nearby immediately dive down to help <<childname>> hold <<bhim>> down.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            在不远处的<<childrenNames _tempIDs>>立刻俯冲而下，帮助<<childname>>压住<<bhim>>。
        <</language>>
        <<if $monster is 1>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              "Damn it, since when were there so many birds here?!"
            <<option 'CN'>>
              "见鬼，这里什么时候有这么多鸟了？！"
          <</language>>
        <</if>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Their attack makes the <<beasttype>> flinch in pain. <<bHe>> thrashes wildly, throwing your children off one by one, their talons full of reddish-brown fur. <<bHe>> seizes the chance and flees.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            他们的攻击让<<beasttype>>吃痛地退缩，<<bHe>>疯狂地甩动身体，你的孩子们纷纷被甩开，爪里抓着红棕色的毛。<<bHe>>抓住机会逃跑了。
        <</language>>
      <<elseif $spray gte 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You seize the chance, pull out your pepper spray on the <<beasttype>>, and spray <<bhim>> hard.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你抓住机会，对着<<beasttype>>掏出了防狼喷雾，对准<<bhim>>一阵猛喷。
        <</language>>
        <<spray -1>><<def 1>>
        <br>
        <<if $monster is 1>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              "Ow! Damn it!"
            <<option 'CN'>>
              "嗷！该死！"
          <</language>>
        <</if>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> howls in pain and whimpers. <<bHe>> gives up on attacking and turns to flee into the bushes.
            <br><br>
            <<childname>> sneezes from the lingering spray.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>顿时痛苦哀嚎，呜咽不已。<<bHe>>放弃了袭击的念头，转身逃进了灌木丛里。
            <br><br>
            <<childname>>因为弥散的喷雾味打了个喷嚏。
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            and the <<beasttype>> immediately breaks free and roars at you. <<bHe>> lunges straight at you!
          <<option 'CN'>>
            而<<beasttype>>立刻趁机脱身，冲着你们咆哮。<<bHe>>猛地扑向了你！
        <</language>>
        <br><br>
        <<lanLink ["Continue", "继续"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight">>
          <<set $fightstart to 1>>
        <</lanLink>>
        <br>
        <<exitAll>>
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if $phase is 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<bHe>> left something behind. <<childname>> seems pleased and struts over with their chest out to pick up the object.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<bHe>>留下了什么东西。<<childname>>似乎很愉快，挺胸昂首地走过去捡起了那个物件。
        <</language>>
        <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<childname>> hops to your side and nuzzles you proudly. You stroke <<childhim>>'s head.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<childname>>跳到你身边，自豪地轻蹭着你。你摸了摸<<childhim>>的脑袋。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<earnFeat "Wild Animals">>
      <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
    <<else>>
      <<if $bestialitydisable is "f">>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You have no time to run before <<bhe>> charges at you.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你根本没时间逃跑，<<bhe>>就向你猛冲过来。
        <</language>>
        <br><br>
        <<lanLink ["Continue", "继续"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight">>
          <<set $fightstart to 1>>
        <</lanLink>>
        <br>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You try to fly into the sky to avoid <<bhe>>, but <<bhe>> is faster and lands a few hits on you.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你想要飞到天上避开<<bhe>>，但<<bhe>>更快一步攻击到了你几下。
        <</language>>
        <<beastescape>>
        <br><br>
        <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <!--未调用-->
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> backs away a few steps, growls at you, then quickly flees.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>从后退几步，冲你低吼着，然后迅速逃走了。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You prepare to land in front of the <<beasttype>>, but <<bhe>> seems to sense you. <<bHe>> quickly starts to flee, then darts into a tree hollow.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你准备降落到<<beasttype>>面前，但<<bhe>>好像察觉到了你。<<bHe>>迅速开始逃跑，然后钻进了一个树坑里。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <<childSelect _tempIDs[0]>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch regretfully as <<bHe>> runs off.
        <br>
        <<childname>> chatters at you a few times and flies over to the tree hollow with a beat of their wings. <<childHe>> sticks their
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>遗憾地看着<<bHe>>跑走。
        <br>
        <<childname>>对你叽喳几声，拍打着翅膀飞向了树坑。<<childHe>>把
    <</language>>
    <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("hand","手") : lanSwitch("talon","爪子")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        into the hollow, trying to find the <<beasttype>>'s trail,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        塞进树洞里，试图找到<<beasttype>>的踪迹，
    <</language>>
    <<if $rng gte 50>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          but is startled by a claw suddenly thrust out.
          <br>
          You hear the <<beasttype>> hissing a threat, and you tell <<childname>> to stay away from the cat so they don't get attacked. <<childHe>> returns to your side.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          却被一只猛地伸出来的爪子吓了一跳。
          <br>
          你听到<<beasttype>>嘶嘶威胁的声音，让<<childname>>离开那只猫以免被攻击。<<childHe>>回到了你身边。
      <</language>>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          but pulls a small object out of the hollow.
          <br>
          <<childHe>> flies back to your side with the object,
        <<option 'CN'>>
          却从树坑里掏出了一个小物件。
          <br>
          <<childHe>>带着那个物件飞回了你身边，
      <</language>>
      <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          but finds nothing.
          <br>
          <<childname>> flies back to your side, dejected.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          但什么都没有发现。
          <br>
          <<childname>>沮丧地飞回了你身边。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Take []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You hold out your hand, signaling for <<bhim>> to hand the thing over.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你伸出手，示意<<bhim>>将那样东西交出来。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clever")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> pants and whines, then brings out the thing hidden behind its back.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>一边喘着气，一边呜呜叫着，拿出了藏在背后的东西。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Oh, is that all it takes? Fine." <<bHe>> takes the thing out from behind its back.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "哦，这样就行吗？好吧。"<<bHe>>从背后拿出了那个东西。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> hesitantly takes it out from behind its back.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>犹豫地将它从背后拿了出来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<flight_hunt_get_random>>
<<set $phase to 3>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Pet", "抚摸"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Pet">>
  <<stress -3>>
<</lanLink>>
<<lstress>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Leave", "离开"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Leave">><</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Leave []
<<effects>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Play No []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You do not think letting your children play with a <<beasttype>> is a good idea.
    <br><br>
    You spread your wings and let out a threatening screech, making the <<beasttype>> puff up once again.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你不认为让你的孩子和一只<<beasttype>>一起玩是个好主意。
    <br><br>
    你张开翅膀，发出一声威吓的尖啸，吓得<<beasttype>>又一次炸毛。
<</language>>
<br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "O-okay." <<bHe>> turns and flees in a panic.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "好，好吧。"<<bHe>>仓惶地转身逃跑了。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> whines dejectedly and turns to flee.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>沮丧地呜呜叫，转身逃走了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> left something behind.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>留下了什么东西。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Crying out in complaint, <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> are led away by you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      抱怨地大叫着，<<childrenNames _tempIDs>>被你带着离开。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Play Yes []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You decide to see what the <<beasttype>> intends to do.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你决定看看<<beasttype>>准备做些什么。
<</language>>
<<run maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
<<childSelect _tempIDs[0]>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The <<beasttype>> keeps wagging its tail, until <<childname>> hesitantly steps forward and tries to approach the big fluffy tail. Before <<childhe>> can touch the <<beasttype>>, <<bHe>> suddenly dodges aside, circles around to <<childname>>'s flank, and pounces at <<childhim>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<beasttype>>继续摇晃着尾巴，直到<<childname>>犹豫着上前，试图靠近那根毛茸茸的大尾巴。在<<childhe>>接触到<<beasttype>>之前，<<bHe>>忽地躲开，绕到<<childname>>的身侧扑向<<childhim>>。
<</language>>
<<gstress>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childname>> is startled into flight, but the <<beasttype>> only stays where it is, lies down again, and wags its tail, waiting for <<childname>> to come closer. After several rounds back and forth, you understand how this game works: pouncing on each other's tails.
    <br>
    Your children understand it too,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childname>>被惊得飞起，但<<beasttype>>只是停在原地，又一次趴下摇尾巴等待<<childname>>靠近。这样反复的几次来往之后，你明白了这场游戏的运作方式：互相扑尾巴。
    <br>
    你的孩子也一样理解了，
<</language>>
<<if _length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      and <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> all join in,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>都加入了进来，
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    and they fall into an endless game of chasing one another.
    <br><br>
    You stand to the side, making sure no one uses their claws and hurts another. A <<beasttype>> and
  <<option 'CN'>>
    他们开始了循环往复的互相追逐。
    <br><br>
    你站在一旁，确保他们没有伸出爪子互相伤害。一只<<beasttype>>和一
<</language>>
<<= _length gt 1 ? lanSwitch("a flock of","群") : lanSwitch("a","只")>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpies","哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    playing together in a mock hunt. If Sirris knew about this, <<nnpc_him "Sirris">> might launch a whole new ecological study.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一起用模拟狩猎的方式玩耍，如果西里斯知道这件事，<<nnpc_him "Sirris">>可能会开启一场新的生态调研。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt _length>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other chicks watch without understanding for a while, but eventually follow their instincts and join their <<childsiblings _tempIDs>>. The <<beasttype>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他孩子不明就里地看了一会儿，最终还是遵循本能加入了自己的<<childsiblings _tempIDs>>。<<beasttype>>
  <</language>>
  <<= $monster ? lanSwitch("laughs and pants,","笑着喘息，") : lanSwitch("lets out a string of sharp barks,","发出许多尖锐的吠叫，")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      seeming to enjoy pouncing into the middle of a large flock of
    <<option 'CN'>>
      似乎很享受扑到一大群
  <</language>>
  <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpy chick","小哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      .
    <<option 'CN'>>
      中间的感觉。
  <</language>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The <<beasttype>> also pulls out
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<beasttype>>还掏出了
  <</language>>
  <<rng 5>>
  <<switch $rng>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          a big stick
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一根大木棍
      <</language>>
    <<case 2>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          a lurker
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一只潜伏者
      <</language>>
    <<case 3>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          a piece of torn fabric
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一块破损的布料
      <</language>>
    <<case 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          a particularly shiny stone
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一块特别闪亮的石头
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<set _looted to either("watch", "ring", "necklace", "bracelet")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一
      <</language>>
      <<print _looted.replace("watch", lanSwitch("watch","块手表")).replace("ring", lanSwitch("ring","个指环")).replace("necklace", lanSwitch("necklace","条项链")).replace("bracelet", lanSwitch("bracelet","条手链"))>>
  <</switch>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      as a toy, apparently something <<bHe>> found earlier.
      Your children toss these things through the air, while the <<beasttype>> does the hard work of leaping up and trying to intercept them in midair.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      作为玩具，似乎是<<bHe>>之前找到的东西。
      你的孩子把这些东西在空中抛来抛去，而<<beasttype>>负责奋力跳起，试图在空中截住它。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<bird_pass 20>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    They play for a good while, until the <<beasttype>> lies on the ground exhausted, panting with its tongue out.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    他们玩了好一会儿，直到<<beasttype>>精疲力竭地躺在地上，气喘吁吁地吐着舌头。
<</language>>
<br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> laughs happily, "That was fun! Children always have so much energy."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>高兴地大笑，"真好玩！孩子们总是很有精力。"
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> lets out a few loud barks that sound a little like laughter, tail wagging happily.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>发出了几声听起来有点像笑声的高声吠叫，尾巴开心地摇晃着。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawks>> land on the ground to rest too, looking content.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>也落在地上休息，看起来心满意足。
<</language>>
<<stress -6>><<lstress>><<trauma -6>><<ltrauma>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You walk over to the <<beasttype>> and gently pet <<bHe>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你走向<<beasttype>>，轻轻抚摸<<bHe>>。
<</language>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Thanks for playing with me," <<bhe>> says. "I wish all the big birds were like you..."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "谢谢你们陪我玩，"<<bhe>>说道。"我真希望所有的大鸟都像你一样……"
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<bHe>> nuzzles you with its nose, then gets up and slips into the bushes.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<bHe>>用鼻子蹭了蹭你，然后起身钻进了灌木丛。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> leaves the toys behind as a gift.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>留下了玩具作为礼物。
  <</language>>
  <<switch $rng>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<flight_hunt_get "sticks" 1>>
    <<case 2>>
      <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 1>>
    <<case 3>>
      <<flight_hunt_get "fabric" 1>>
    <<case 4>>
      <<flight_hunt_get "junk" 1>>
    <<default>>
      <<flight_hunt_get "valuables" 1 _looted>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<earnFeat "Dances with Fox">>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Pet []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You reach out your hand. <<bHe>> flinches, but as you begin scratching behind <<bhis>> ears, <<bHe>> calms down.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你伸出手。<<bHe>>畏缩了一下，但随着你开始抓挠<<bhis>>的耳后，<<bHe>>冷静了下来。
<</language>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> leans into you as you scratch <<bhis>> ears. Your other hand reaches behind <<bhis>> back and begins to slide your fingers gently along <<bhis>> tail.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>在你抓挠<<bhis>>的耳朵时，靠到了你身上。你的另一只手伸向<<bhis>>身后，开始温柔地用手指滑过<<bhis>>的尾巴。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The fox purrs gratefully as you keep rubbing between <<bhis>> ears, and your other hand begins to stroke <<bhis>> back.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      狐狸感激地呼噜叫着，你一边继续摩擦<<bhis>>的耳间，另一只手开始抚摸<<bhis>>的后背。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Your children
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你的孩子
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      s
    <<option 'CN'>>
      们
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    watch curiously as you pet <<bhim>>.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    好奇地看着你抚摸<<bhim>>。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
  <<childSelect _tempIDs[0]>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname>> is the first to come forward,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname>>第一个凑上前来，
  <</language>>
  <<if $cmonster>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        imitating your movements and gently running their fingers through the <<beasttype>>'s fur.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        学着你的动作用手指轻轻抚过<<beasttype>>的皮毛。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childhe>> tries to imitate you and rubs their beak gently against the <<beasttype>>'s fur.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childhe>>试图模仿你的动作，用喙轻轻磨蹭<<beasttype>>的皮毛。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The soft feel of the fur seems to please <<childhe>> greatly. <<childhe>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      毛发的柔软触感似乎让<<childhe>>相当满意。<<childhe>>
  <</language>>
  <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("giggles","咯咯地笑着") : lanSwitch("trills cooingly","咕咕的颤鸣着")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      , over and over
    <<option 'CN'>>
      ，一遍遍地
  <</language>>
  <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("Pet","抚摸") : lanSwitch("rubbing against","磨蹭")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      the <<beasttype>>.
      <br><br>
      The <<beasttype>> stiffens for a moment at <<childname>>'s touch. But soon, <<bhis>> whines rise high, and its legs begin to kick instinctively.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<beasttype>>。
      <br><br>
      <<beasttype>>因为<<childname>>的接触僵硬了一瞬间。但很快，<<bhis>>呜呜地高声叫着，开始本能地踢腿。
  <</language>>
  <<if _length gt 1>>
    <<run _tempIDs = _tempIDs.filter(item => item !== _tempIDs[0])>>
    <br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> come over too and crowd around the <<beasttype>>,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>也凑过来围在<<beasttype>>身边，
    <</language>>
    <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("several pairs of little hands stroking over","好几双小手一起摸上") : lanSwitch("several hawk chicks curiously nibbling at","好几只小鹰好奇地轻咬着")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bhim>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bhim>>。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <br>
    <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clever")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "You—you lot! Easy! Don't pull my fur!" <<bhe>> pants.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "你，你们！轻点！别扯我的毛！"<<bhe>>喘息着。
      <</language>>
    <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clumsy")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Th-this is too much..." <<bhe>> sounds so good it is nearly crying.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "这，这太过分了……"<<bhe>>听起来舒服得快哭了。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clumsy")>>
  <<childSelect _tempIDs[0]>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname>> also comes over and clumsily imitates your movements,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname>>也靠过来，笨拙地模仿你的动作，
  <</language>>
  <<if $cmonster>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        running their hands along the <<beasttype>>'s fur. It is fine at first, but as <<childhe>> begins to feel the softness under their hands, <<childname>> gets carried away and rubs the <<beasttype>> from top to bottom with no regard for force.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        用手捋过<<beasttype>>的皮毛。起初还好，但随着<<childhe>>逐渐感受到手下柔软的触感，<<childname>>玩心大发，毫不顾忌力道地把<<beasttype>>从上撸到下。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        taking the <<beasttype>>'s fur in their beak. It is fine at first, but as <<childhe>> begins to feel the softness, <<childname>> gets carried away and yanks out a tuft of fox fur with no regard for force.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        用喙叼住<<beasttype>>的毛发。起初还好，但随着<<childhe>>逐渐感受到毛发柔软的触感，<<childname>>玩心大发，毫不顾忌力道地叨下一撮狐狸毛。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The <<beasttype>> shrieks and leaps to its feet,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<beasttype>>尖叫一声跳了起来，
  <</language>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clever")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Damn it, I knew I shouldn't have let my guard down around a harpy!" <<bHe>> barks at you threateningly.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "可恶，我就知道不该对哈比掉以轻心！"<<bHe>>威胁地冲你们吠叫。
      <</language>>
      <<stress 4>><<gstress>>
    <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clumsy")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Ow! Don't touch me!" <<bHe>> barks at you threateningly.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "好痛！别碰我！"<<bHe>>威胁地冲你们吠叫。
      <</language>>
      <<stress 4>><<gstress>>
    <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("friendly")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Ow! Ow! Stop it!" <<bHe>> curls its tail in pain.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "噢！噢！住手！"<<bHe>>吃痛地蜷起尾巴。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includesAny("friendly")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          curling its tail in pain.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          吃痛地蜷起尾巴。
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          barking at you threateningly.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          威胁地冲你们吠叫。
      <</language>>
      <<stress 4>><<gstress>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe>> turns and runs away. <<childname>> looks bewildered.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe>>转身跑走了。<<childname>>看起来很迷茫。
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch regretfully as <<bHe>> runs off.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>遗憾地看着<<bHe>>跑远。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        A few minutes later, the <<beasttype>> leaves your side. <<bHes>> face is red. Without a word, <<bhe>> turns and walks away.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        几分钟后，<<beasttype>>离开了你身边。<<bHes>>脸红了。<<bhe>>一言不发，转身走开了。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        A few minutes pass like that, and the fox runs into the bushes with a cheerful call.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        就这样过了几分钟，狐狸欢快地叫着跑进了灌木丛。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight []
<<if $fightstart is 1>>
  <<set $fightstart to 0>>
  <<violence 1>>
  <<neutral 1>>
  <<beastCombatInit>>
  <<set $enemytrust to -100>>
  <<set $enemyanger to 200>>
  <<set $timer to 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $timer is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="blue">You see <<babyhawks>> screech and pounce onto the <<beasttype>>.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="blue">你看到<<babyhawks>>尖啸着扑到<<beasttype>>的身上。</span>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<set $enemyhealth -= maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*10>>
<<else>>
  <<set _rng to random(0, maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length-1)>>
  <<switch random(1,4)>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>>'s talons sink into the <<beasttype>>'s fur. <<bHe>> shrieks and attacks you.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>>的爪子没入<<beasttype>>的皮毛。<<bHe>>尖叫着攻击你们。</span>
      <</language>>
    <<case 2>>
      <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("rips out","扯下了") : lanSwitch("pecks out","啄下了")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          a big tuft of the <<beasttype>>'s fur. <<bHe>> cries out in pain.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<beasttype>>一大撮毛。<<bHe>>吃痛地嗷嗷叫。</span>
      <</language>>
    <<case 3>>
      <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("grabs","抓住") : lanSwitch("bites","叼住")>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          the <<beasttype>>'s ear and tugs at it. The <<beasttype>> whips its head around, trying to shake <<childhim $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>> off.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<beasttype>>的耳朵撕扯。<<beasttype>>猛地甩头，试图甩开<<childhim $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>>。</span>
      <</language>>
    <<case 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>> beats their wings and clings tightly to the <<beasttype>>. Feathers and down scatter through the air.</span>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <span class="blue"><<childname $BirdTower.hunt.ids[_rng]>>拍打着翅膀紧紧抓着<<beasttype>>不放。羽毛和绒毛漫天飞散。</span>
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<set $enemyhealth -= maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*20>>
  <<set $enemytrust to -100>>
  <<set $enemyanger to 200>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate lanSwitch("<span class=\"red\"><<bHe>> shrieks directly at you, drowning out your own scream.</span>","<span class=\"red\"><<bHe>>直接冲着你发出尖叫，将你的尖叫声淹没。</span>")>>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
  <span id="next"><<lanLink ["Next", "继续"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight Finish">><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
  <span id="next"><<lanLink ["Next", "继续"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight">><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Fight Finish []
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<beastejaculation>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> stands up and looks at you smugly. "And I thought you were terrifying. You're just a toy." <<bHe>> slips into the bushes.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>站起身，得意地看着你。"我还以为你很恐怖呢。你只是个玩具。"<<bHe>>溜进了灌木丛里。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> snorts smugly, then slips into the bushes.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>得意地哼着气，然后溜进了灌木丛里。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<tearful>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stand up.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你站了起来。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> flinches and bares its teeth at you. "Wretched harpy..."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>退缩了，冲你呲起牙。"可恶的哈比……"
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> rolls off you, panting in frustration.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>从你身上滚开，沮丧地喘着气。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The <<beasttype>> whimpers and flees into the bushes.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<beasttype>>呜咽着逃进了灌木丛中。
  <</language>>
  <<earnFeat "Wild Animals">>
  <<if $phase is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> left something behind.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>留下了什么东西。
    <</language>>
    <<flight_hunt_get_random>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<tearful>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You pull yourself together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你振作了起来。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> stands up and looks at you smugly. "And I thought you were terrifying. You're just a weakling." The <<beasttype>> leaves your side and slips away into the moor.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>站起身，得意地看着你。"我还以为你很恐怖呢。你就是个弱鸡。"<<beasttype>>从你身边离开，溜进了荒原。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> snorts smugly, then slips into the bushes.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>得意地哼着气，然后溜进了灌木丛里。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<tearful>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You pull yourself together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你振作了起来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You catch <<babyhawks>> as they rush into your arms; <<babyhawksthem>> nuzzle affectionately against your cheeks, trilling worriedly.
    <br>
    You comfort and check each other over, resting for a good while before leaving.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你抱住冲进你怀里的<<babyhawks>>，<<babyhawksthem>>亲昵地蹭着你的脸颊，发出担心的颤鸣。
    <br>
    你们互相安慰检查着休息了好一会儿才离开。
<</language>>
<<ltiredness>><<tiredness -10>><<lpain>><<pain -10>>
<<bird_pass 10>>
<br><br>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Animal Screech []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
