:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Foxes Land []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You land near them. <<babyhawks>> land beside you.
    You keep close to the ground to stay hidden and creep closer to watch. <<babyhawks>> follow behind you.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你降落在他们附近。<<babyhawks>>降落在你身边。
    你贴近地面，保持不被发现，凑近观察。<<babyhawks>>跟在你的身后。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $rng gte 60>>
  <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includes("territorial")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The larger one charges at the other.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        大的那只冲着另一只冲了过去。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Giving up?" <<bHe 0>> sits atop the smaller <<beasttype 1>>, smiling smugly.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "放弃了吗？"<<bHe 0>>骑在小一些的<<beasttype 1>>身上，得意地笑着。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
      <<if $NPCList[1].traits.includes("territorial")>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Never!" The smaller <<beasttype 1>> rolls out from under <<bhim 0>>, and <<bHe 0>> keep wrestling, tumbling into the bushes.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            "绝不！"小一些的<<beasttype 1>>从<<bhim 0>>身下滚出，<<bHe 0>>们持续扭打着，滚进了灌木丛里。
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Y-yes. Sorry. I'll go hunt somewhere else," the smaller <<beasttype 1>> whines.
            <br><br>
            The larger one snorts, gets off, and lets the smaller one go. The smaller one immediately flees. The victor strolls away at ease, seeming to resume the hunt that was interrupted.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            "是、是的。对不起。我会去其它地方打猎的，"小一些的<<beasttype 1>>呜呜叫着。
            <br><br>
            大一些的哼了哼气，从对方身上下去，放开了小的那个。小的那个立刻逃走了。胜利者悠悠闲闲地走开了，似乎重新开始了被打断的狩猎。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<bHe>> yips and whines at the smaller one,
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<bHe>>嗷呜着对那个小的发出嘤嘤声，
      <</language>>
      <<if $NPCList[1].traits.includes("territorial")>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            and the smaller one rolls out from under <<bHe>> and throws a punch. <<bHe>> tumble into the bushes.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            而小的那个则从<<bHe>>身下滚出，挥出一拳。<<bHe>>们翻滚进了灌木丛。
        <</language>>
      <<else>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            then lets go of <<bhim 1>>. <<bHe 1>> flees, and the victorious fox strolls away at ease.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            然后放开了<<bhim 1>>。<<bHe 1>>逃走了，胜利的狐狸悠闲地离开了。
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        One pounces on the other with a growl.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        其中一个猛扑向另一个，发出低吼声。
    <</language>>
    <<if $monster is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "You ruined my prey!" <<bhe 0>> yowls.
          <br>
          "I saw it first!" Beneath <<bhim 0>>, the <<beasttype 1>> also roars back at <<bhim 0>>. <<bHe 1>> rolls out from under <<bhim 0>> and lunges back at <<bhis 0>>. The two of <<bhis 0>> chase each other deep into the moor.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "你弄砸了我的猎物！"<<bhe 0>>嗷呜叫。
          <br>
          "是我先看到的！"<<bhim 0>>身下的<<beasttype 1>>也冲<<bhim 0>>吼着。<<bHe 1>>从<<bhim 0>>身下滚出，反击地扑向<<bhis 0>>。<<bhis 0>>们两个互相追逐着跑进了荒原深处。
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The two of them roar at each other for a while, then go back to wrestling. They chase each other deep into the moor.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          他们两个冲着对方吼叫了一会儿，然后继续扭打起来。他们互相追逐着跑进了荒原深处。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> watch <<beasttype 0>> intently, until <<bhe>> leaves.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>专注地观察着<<beasttype 0>>，直到<<bhe>>离开。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("dominant")>>
    <<childSelect  _tempIDs[0]>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname>> watches the fight between the foxes with great interest.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname>>饶有兴趣地看着狐狸之间的争斗。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br>
  <<lanLink ["Leave", "离开"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Leave">><</lanLink>>
  <br>
<<elseif $rng gte 30>>
  <<set _mom to ($NPCList[0].pronoun is "f" ? lanSwitch("mom","妈妈") : lanSwitch("dad","爸爸"))>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Looking closer, you realize that one of the <<beasttype 1>> is especially small, and <<bHe 1>> still has pale, greyish fur.
      <span class="green">You soon realize this is a pair of
    <<option 'CN'>>
      凑近观察后你才发现，其中一只<<beasttype 1>>格外小，<<bHe 1>>身上的毛发还是灰扑扑的浅色。
      <span class="green">你很快意识到这是一对
  <</language>>
  <<switch $NPCList[0].pronoun>>
    <<case "f">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          mother
        <<option 'CN'>>
          母
      <</language>>
    <<case "m">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          father
        <<option 'CN'>>
          父
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <<switch $NPCList[1].pronoun>>
    <<case "f">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          daughter
        <<option 'CN'>>
          女
      <</language>>
    <<case "m">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          son
        <<option 'CN'>>
          子
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      .</span>
      <br><br>
      <<bHe 1>>'s
    <<option 'CN'>>
      。</span>
      <br><br>
      <<bHe 1>>的
  <</language>>
  <<print _mom>>
  <<if $NPCList[0].traits.includes("territorial")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        is nibbling at the <<beasttype 1>>, stopping <<bHe 1>> from acting up.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        正轻咬着<<beasttype 1>>，制止<<bHe 1>>调皮捣乱的行为。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clever")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        is lying lazily on the ground, wagging its tail to deal with the restless little <<beasttype 1>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        正懒洋洋地躺在地上，摇晃着尾巴应付好动的小<<beasttype 1>>。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("friendly")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        is playing with <<bHe 1>>, chasing each other until <<bHe 0>> rolls onto its back, panting in surrender.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        正陪着<<bHe 1>>玩耍，他们互相追逐，直到<<bHe 0>>翻着肚皮，喘着气做出投降的姿态。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("clumsy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        is trying to groom the <<beasttype 1>>'s fur, but the little <<beasttype 1>> quickly runs out from under <<bHe 0>>'s
      <<option 'CN'>>
        正试图梳理<<beasttype 1>>的毛发，但小<<beasttype 1>>快速地从<<bHe 0>>的
    <</language>>
    <<= $monster ? lanSwitch("hand","手") : lanSwitch("mouth","嘴")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        and makes
      <<option 'CN'>>
        下跑开，让
    <</language>>
    <<print _mom>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        chase after <<bHe 1>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        不得不追着<<bHe 1>>跑。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $NPCList[0].traits.includes("cowardly")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        is staying alert to its surroundings, but <<bHe 0>> keeps getting pestered by the little <<beasttype 1>> pouncing on it.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        正警惕着四周，但<<bHe 0>>不断地被扑到身上的小<<beasttype 1>>打扰。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your children
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的孩子
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        all
      <<option 'CN'>>
        们全都
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      stare curiously at the little <<beasttype 1>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      好奇地盯着这只小<<beasttype 1>>。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanLink ["Keep watching (0:10)", "继续观看 (0:10)"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Foxes Watch">>
    <<bird_pass 10>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <br>
  <<lanLink ["Leave", "离开"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Fox Leave">><</lanLink>>
  <br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      They each crouch close to the ground, then get ready and start calling at each other. One jumps forward, knocks the other over, and nuzzles against <<bhim>>. They are only playing.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      他们各自贴近地面，然后做好准备，冲着对方叫喊起来。其中一个向前跳了一步，撞倒了另一个，轻蹭着<<bhim>>。他们只是在嬉闹。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clumsy")>>
